{
  "name": "default_case — PLAN §10 defaults (hand-calc regression benchmark)",
  "comments": {
    "derivation": [
      "wu = 1.2*(5525+2100+600)/1000 + 1.6*5.205 = 18.198 klf (governing 1.2D+1.6L, UDL-LL on).",
      "Truss loads = UDL between centerlines only (PLAN §1): R_t = 18.198*26/2 = 236.574 k.",
      "Routed outboard strips (1.25 ft = strip to centerline; o = x_L - lb/2 = 0 beyond outer face,",
      "0 <= h_disp = 192 in -> passes the 45-degree dispersion-footprint rule explicitly, checks trivially 0).",
      "R_bearing = 236.574 + 18.198*1.25 = 259.32 k. Mmax = wu*Ls^2/8 = 1537.73 k-ft (N=10 lumping is exact at the 0.45L/0.55L vertices).",
      "z from z^2 - hp*z + Mmax/(2*fce*tw) = 0, hp = 188.5, fce = 0.75*0.85*0.75*3 = 1.434375 ksi -> z = 185.612 in = 15.47 ft;",
      "T = H = Mmax/z = 99.416 k (plan expectation 99 k +/-5%); theta_spr = atan(R_t/H) = 67.206 deg (plan 67 +/-2).",
      "Anchorage (hooks; AUDIT-FIXES A2, Table 25.4.3.2 implemented exactly): hooked-bar c/c spacing",
      "s = (b_gb - 2*cover_side - db)/(n-1) = (24 - 4 - 1.0)/3 = 6.3333 in >= 6db = 6.0 in -> psi_r = 1.0 via disjunct (b)",
      "(spacing of the HOOKED BARS, not tie spacing). ldh = (60000*1.0*1.0*1.25*0.8/(55*sqrt(3000)))*1.0^1.5",
      "= 60000/3012.474 = 19.9172 in >= max(8db, 6) -> 19.9172 in. Available 29.4603 in (governing pattern = 1.2D-only:",
      "lightest arch -> largest z -> steepest theta -> least embedment). DCR = 19.9172/29.4603 = 0.6761 -> PASS.",
      "(Pre-A2 the same case read psi_r = 1.6 -> ldh 31.8675, an honest FAIL at DCR 1.082; the corrected table condition",
      "legitimately earns 1.0 here. The db^1.5 exponent (A1) is invisible at db = 1.0 - see fixture ldh_bar_sizes.)"
    ]
  },
